    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. So when you say Area C is a \"complicated investment,\" are you saying that the demographic makeup and the poverty levels there make the recovery less \"efficient\" in terms of ROI? Like, is it a risk to put resources there because the community might not have the same capacity to rebuild compared to Area A or B?",
